  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Surface Placement puts content on the real
    floors, walls and tables around you.
    
    Hold your view steady on a floor or wall, or
    lay your palm flat on a table, until the ring
    fills. No pinch needed. Drag the menu to slide
    the cube along the surface, or pinch Reset
    Placement to place it again.
    Use Previous / Next to switch modes.
